        "sha256": "d4a6cce5d1806a56e95c258e1d577c37db3d5ce690560f56e9f1543aa7f06e48",
        "source_notes": "Source: NBRC Medium 925 | Link: https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=925\n\nNBRC lists Methanosaeta harundinacea medium with sodium acetate, mineral salts, trace elements, vitamins, Bacto Yeast Extract, Hipolypepton, resazurin, KHCO3, cysteine-HCl, Na2S, and distilled water. The basal medium is autoclaved under N2/CO2, cysteine-HCl and Na2S·9H2O are autoclaved separately under N2, the vitamin solution is filter-sterilized, and the final medium pH is 7.2-7.5.",
